OL,3,GNEWSAScottish government aiming to
OL,4,Areplicate chancellor's #100 energy
OL,5,Apayment scheme
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Scottish government is seeking to
OL,8,Freplicate a UK government scheme
OL,9,Fannounced by the chancellor which will
OL,10,Fgive #100 to households in England in
OL,11,Flower council tax bands this winter.
OL,13,FUnveiling the measure in the Autumn
OL,14,FBudget, Chancellor John Healey said
OL,15,FHolyrood ministers would receive
OL,16,Fproportionate funding and urged them to
OL,17,Fprovide the payment north of the
OL,18,Fborder.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
