OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAScottish government aiming to
OL,4,Areplicate chancellor's #100 energy
OL,5,Apayment scheme
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Labour minister said the payment
OL,8,Fwould "help deal with rising energy
OL,9,Fbills and take the pressure off in the
OL,10,Fcoldest months".
OL,12,FDeputy First Minister Jenny Gilruth
OL,13,Ftold BBC Scotland News that her
OL,14,Fgovernment was considering how best to
OL,15,Fdeliver an equivalent scheme, while
OL,16,Fdescribing the Budget as a "missed
OL,17,Fopportunity".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
